# Spark IDE — proven ide show forms (bare + quoted .ppm path).
# After keys-open. Forms already live in ide_show / keys show -
# this slice documents+tests both in one example.
# Proof: both emit {"op":"ide.show","ok":true}; engine show.json
# path out/ide/editor.ppm; no Electron.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_show_forms.spark
